# Commands that skip interactive plan/diff display — these need a plan-review
# marker IN ADDITION TO the apply-confirmation marker in infra-gate.patterns.
# Bare `terraform apply` / `cdk deploy` (no auto-approve flag) are NOT here —
# the tool itself forces a human to see the plan via its own prompt.
#
# Deliberately EMPTY, same reasoning as the sibling infra-gate.patterns:
# this project has zero cloud infrastructure, zero Terraform, zero cloud CLI
# usage — the upstream kit's Terraform/CDK/CloudFormation/SAM defaults would
# be unreviewed dead weight here (and are currently unreachable regardless,
# since require-infra-approval.sh only consults this file after a command
# already matched something in infra-gate.patterns, which is also empty).
# If this project ever grows real infra tooling, add matching patterns to
# BOTH files together — see CLAUDE.md's "Infra change policy" section.
